            "text": "<strong>A1 Executive Mobility System</strong> </br>A1 is a flagship 26L Executive Mobility System for professionals who carry valuable technology, move through high-stakes schedules, and need one bag to keep work essentials, personal items and a complete 48-hour business travel load protected, organized and ready.",
